पनिष्टम, अस्, आ, अम् (perhaps for पनिष्ठ-
तम, cf. नेदिष्ठ-तम), Ved. highly praised;
(but Sāy. takes it for 1st pers. pl. = स्तुमः.)

पानस पानस, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. पनस), pre-
pared from the fruit of the Jaka or bread-fruit tree;
(अम्), n. a spirituous liquor so prepared.

पान्त, अस्, m., Ved. = 1. पानीय, a drink, beverage;
(Sāy.) = पालन-स्वभाव, nutritious (as if fr. rt.
3. पा).

पांसव, अस्, आ, अम्, formed or consisting of dust;
(अस्), m. a patronymic (Ved.); a kind of salt (in
this sense spelt पांशव).
